      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a year ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "We ordered several main course menu such as Beef Dabu-Dabu, Ayam Afrika, Cordon Bleu, etc.\n\nI love their Beef Dabu-Dabu that served with mashed potato, the smokiness of the beef is 10/10.\n\nBeen loving their Ayam Afrika since the first time I try it in 2022.\n\nTheir ambience is also 10/10 for hangingout or work from cafe.\n\n100% would love to comeback again.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
